<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>LoofaryBot Dashboard</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <script src="/js/theme.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <div class="brand">🎁 LoofaryBot</div>
    <% if (user) { %>
      <a class="btn" href="/dashboard">Go to Dashboard</a>
    <% } else { %>
      <a class="btn" href="/auth/discord">Login with Discord</a>
    <% } %>
  </nav>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="hero-badge"><span class="pulse-dot"></span> Online as <%= botTag %> · in <%= guildCount %> server<%= guildCount === 1 ? '' : 's' %></div>
      <h1>Everything LoofaryBot does, in one place</h1>
      <p>Persistent giveaways, an anti-raid honeypot, XP leveling with role rewards, auto-role on join,
        and a visual embed builder with saved templates — configure it all without touching a slash command.</p>
      <% if (!user) { %>
        <a class="btn" href="/auth/discord">Login with Discord →</a>
      <% } else { %>
        <a class="btn" href="/dashboard">Go to Dashboard →</a>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🎁</div>
        <h3>Giveaways</h3>
        <p class="muted">Persistent giveaways that survive redeploys, with a form-based or slash-command flow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🍯</div>
        <h3>Honeypot</h3>
        <p class="muted">Instant kick/ban/soft-ban trap channel with a live, self-updating counter.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📈</div>
        <h3>Leveling</h3>
        <p class="muted">Tunable XP curve, cooldowns, and automatic role rewards at any milestone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🛡️</div>
        <h3>Auto-Role</h3>
        <p class="muted">Grant a role to every new member automatically, and sync it onto existing members too.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🖌️</div>
        <h3>Embed Builder</h3>
        <p class="muted">Live @/#/emoji autocomplete, a real message-style preview, and saved templates.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🏆</div>
        <h3>Leaderboard</h3>
        <p class="muted">A paginated, avatar-rich XP leaderboard for every server, right in the browser.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
